sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant D as /admin paneli
    participant S as Slim API
    participant P as PostgREST
    participant K as Cache (catalog_*)
    A->>D: Tarih araligi + filtre (from/to/staff/status)
    D->>S: GET /api/admin/appointments?...
    S->>P: aralik sorgusu (max 62 gun)
    P-->>S: randevular
    S-->>D: 200 + liste (Tarih sutunu)
    A->>D: Satirda durum degistir + Kaydet
    D->>S: PATCH /api/admin/appointments/{id}
    S-->>D: 200 + tablo tazele
    A->>D: Hizmet/Usta ekle-duzenle
    D->>S: POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/admin/services|staff
    S->>K: Cache::forget (aninda guncel site)